        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13670.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7a6f154de9fa979384fa91d5516eea5c8f36d79cf6496e5dc72cad2e91bdae47",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2014-06-18/pdf/2014-14432.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (Board). There is established, \neffective 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on June 15, 2014, a Board of \nthree members to be appointed by the President to investigate and report \non these disputes. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested \nin any organization of railroad employees or any carrier. The Board shall \nperform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2303,
      "char_start": 2186,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13670#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13670#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "79 FR 35029, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "89a895c8279fe571bda8b5658f80747a382a76e66fa0ea0d7daba140a09fdfdb",
        "signing_date": "2014-06-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13670.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7a6f154de9fa979384fa91d5516eea5c8f36d79cf6496e5dc72cad2e91bdae47",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2014-06-18/pdf/2014-14432.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to \nthe disputes within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2582,
      "char_start": 2305,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13670#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13670#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "79 FR 35029, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "89a895c8279fe571bda8b5658f80747a382a76e66fa0ea0d7daba140a09fdfdb",
        "signing_date": "2014-06-14",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13670.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7a6f154de9fa979384fa91d5516eea5c8f36d79cf6496e5dc72cad2e91bdae47",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2014-06-18/pdf/2014-14432.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 9A(c) of the RLA, \nfor 120 days from the date of the creation of the Board, no change in \nthe conditions out of which the disputes arose shall be made by the parties \nto the controversy, except by agreement of the parties."
    },
