      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board. \nVerDate Mar<15>2010 19:58 Jun 17, 2014 Jkt 232001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4790 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\18JNE1.SGM 18JNE1emcdonald on DSK67QTVN1PROD with NOTICES3\n=== PDF page 2 of 3 ===\n35030 Federal Register / Vol. 79, No. 117 / Wednesday, June 18, 2014 / Presidential Documents"
